    },
    {
      "text": "在没有独立干预实验（independent_intervention=none）的情况下，无法区分相关性与因果性，因此“candidate driver genes”的表述是合适的，但应避免暗示已验证因果驱动作用。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:independent_intervention"]
    },
    {
      "text": "建议将结论措辞调整为：“These are lineage-correlated candidate driver genes, identified by CellRank fate probability association; causal driver status remains to be validated by independent perturbation.”",
